      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "عَنْهُ عَنِ ابْنِ أَبِي عُمَيْرٍ عَنْ حَمَّادٍ عَنِ الْحَلَبِيِّ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ قَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "From him, from Ibn Abi Umayr, from Hammad, from al-Halabi, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him), who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "«إِذَا أَقَرَّ رَجُلٌ بِوَلَدٍ ثُمَّ نَفَاهُ لَزِمَهُ».",
      "translations": {
        "en": "\"If a man acknowledges a child and then repudiates him, it remains binding upon him.\""
      }
    }
  ],
